    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Grading Policy: In-Class Participation/Assignments/Quizzes &amp; Attendance, 35%; Midterm 40%: Written Test 15% &amp; CDIO Project--CI Contest Round 1 Oral Exam 25%; Final--Segmentation &amp; Sight Translation Written Test,&nbsp;25%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. An in-class, 5-10 minutes short quiz for the previous week's course material will be held in the beginning of the class from Week 3 to Week 15 regularly. Short quizzes, Midterm exam, and Final exam are not to be made up.\n\n2. Punctuality and in-class participation/interpretation and attitude are focuses of evaluation for this course. Students who are over 15 minutes late will be considered absent for the class session. In addition, students who are absent for more than 4 weeks/8 hours (including 8 hours) will not pass this course. (Students who provide medical proof in need of long rest for sicknesses or accidents will be excused from the above policy.)",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "A volunteer will get 0.45 extra point each time he/she volunteers, with the maximum of a total of 8 points towards the final score per semester.",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<ol>\n\t<li>Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。</li>\n\t<li>Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。</li>\n\t<li>Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
